+    The tax refunded so far is always round_half_up(order_tax * refunded / order_total),
+    and each refund takes the difference from what was already refunded. Every split
+    therefore sums to amount_cents, and once the full total has been refunded exactly
+    order_tax_cents and order_subtotal_cents have been reversed.
